<main class="pt-[140px] pb-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
  <div class="text-center max-w-[640px] mx-auto mb-14">
    <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(32px,4vw,48px)] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-4">Everything you need to find<br/>and qualify leads</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-white/60">Technology detection, business classification, revenue scoring, and CSV export, across Shopify, SaaS, and every digital business.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-8">
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#128231;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Business Contact Data</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Published contact addresses collected from the businesses themselves. This is the field store-level databases don't give you. Reach the merchant, not a web form.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128295;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Tech Stack &amp; App Detection</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">230+ technologies and 260+ Shopify apps. Teams that target by tech stack report materially higher win rates, sell to stores already running the tools next to yours.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128200;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Revenue &amp; Employee Estimates</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Revenue brackets and headcount estimates on every business, with the evidence behind them. Qualify by size before you spend a single touch.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#128188;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Hiring Signals</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Open roles, departments and hiring platforms per company. A business that is hiring is growing and spending, the cheapest public buying signal there is.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128717;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Catalogue &amp; Price Intelligence</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Product counts, price bands, new products in the last 30 days, out-of-stock ratios. Target premium stores, growing stores, or exactly the size of store your product fits.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#9889;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Detected Within Hours</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">New stores and sites enter the database within hours of going live, and existing ones are re-scanned continuously. Reach merchants before they have an agency, an app stack, or ten competitors emailing them.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#127760;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Classification &amp; Firmographics</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Business model, industry, country and language on every record, so a filter like "German ecommerce, premium price band, hiring" is one query, not a research project.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128202;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">SEO &amp; Performance Scores</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Every business scored for SEO and page speed. For agencies, a low score with a reachable contact is a pitch that writes itself.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128228;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Clean CSV Export</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Filtered exports built for CRM import, up to 5,000 rows/mo on Starter, 50,000 on Pro. No credits, no per-row fees, no expiring tokens.</p></div>
    <%!-- Coming soon cards --%>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-dashed border-white/[0.07] opacity-50"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128268;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">API &amp; Webhooks <span class="ml-1.5 inline-flex px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider bg-white/[0.06] text-white/30 font-medium">Soon</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Programmatic access and fresh-store webhooks. Coming soon on Pro.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="text-center"><a href="/signup" data-umami-event="signup_cta" data-umami-event-source="features_page" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-8 py-4 font-display text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_8px_28px_rgba(16,185,129,0.25)] hover:bg-accent-hover">Start free, no credit card required</a></div>
</div></main>
